title: "UpLift: Predicting transit station equipment failure before it breaks"
abstract: "Predicts transit elevator and escalator failures 30 days ahead, so Disabled riders aren’t stranded. XGBoost + SHAP, built on synthetic data, pilot-ready for real agency records."
